      "value": "THIS!\n\nI am ultra annoyed by the new window that pops up every time I log into vrchat. It is extremely intrusive and feels like a joke to be FORCED to look at \"ads/news\" while already PAYING the monthly subscription for VRC+. This feels like a rip off.\n\nYes it is only one klick to close the window, but it is extra \"work\" to be able to move. And a bunch of stuff on that page - to be honest I really don´t wanna see it, why force us to do it?\n\nIf vrchat decides to go into that direction I will definitely not further support it in the future. Let us have our freedom!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
