      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes! This one right here!! The first thing I tried to do was find an option to turn off the automatic pop up for the 'Live Now' tab.\n\nIts so annoying every time I open VRChat I see this! I cannot tell you how many times I went to go check my avatars that I uploaded only to realize the UI is different and I clicked on 'Worlds' instead like a chump.\n\nIt would be nice to even be able to remove the tab entirely for your own comfort if you have no interest in looking into it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
